{"ref":"BDB, מַסַּע²","hw":"מַסַּע²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַסַּע</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>pulling up, breaking</strong> camp, setting out, journey;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:2\" href=\"/Numbers.10.2\">Nu 10:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.11\">Dt 10:11</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסְעֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:28\" href=\"/Numbers.10.28\">Nu 10:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:1\" href=\"/Numbers.33.1\">33:1</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסָּעָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:3\" href=\"/Genesis.13.3\">Gn 13:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסְעֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:1\" href=\"/Exodus.17.1\">Ex 17:1</a> + 6 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>pulling up, breaking</em> camp (c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶה</span>; Ges<sup>§ 45e, 115d</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:2\" href=\"/Numbers.10.2\">Nu 10:2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>setting out</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">Nu 10:6</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:28\" href=\"/Numbers.10.28\">28</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>station, stage, journey</em> (by stages), <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֵּלֶךְ לְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:3\" href=\"/Genesis.13.3\">Gn 13:3</a> <em>and he went by</em> (according to) <em>his journeyings</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, הָלַךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_הָלַךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">הלך</a>, p. 231 a supr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמַסְעֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:1\" href=\"/Exodus.17.1\">Ex 17:1</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:36\" href=\"/Exodus.40.36\">40:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:38\" href=\"/Exodus.40.38\">38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:12\" href=\"/Numbers.10.12\">Nu 10:12</a> (all P; all c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָסַע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:1\" href=\"/Numbers.33.1\">33:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:2\" href=\"/Numbers.33.2\">2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵיהֶם</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:2\" href=\"/Numbers.33.2\">2</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קוּם לֵךְ לְמַסַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.11\">Dt 10:11</a> <em>for journeying</em> (v. Dr).","next":"BDB, מַסָּע²","prev":"BDB, נָסַע"}